0.09 0.34 0.28 rg BT /F2 14 Tf 56 656 Td (1. Project overview) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 636 Td (IdeaValidate is a browser-based prototype that helps people think through a business idea) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 622 Td (before investing significant time or money. It guides users through questions about the) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 608 Td (customer problem, market, competitors, financial estimates, and readiness to test. It then) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 594 Td (creates a transparent self-assessment report with risks and suggested next steps.) Tj ET
0.09 0.34 0.28 rg BT /F2 14 Tf 56 575 Td (2. Who it is for) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 555 Td (Aspiring entrepreneurs, students, and small business owners who want a structured starting) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 541 Td (point for examining an idea. It is an educational planning aid, not a guarantee that a) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 527 Td (business will succeed.) Tj ET
0.09 0.34 0.28 rg BT /F2 14 Tf 56 508 Td (3. How to use the app) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 488 Td (1\) Start an assessment from Home or choose a fictional sample idea.) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 474 Td (2\) Describe the idea, category, target market, and current stage.) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 460 Td (3\) Explain the customer problem, who experiences it, and what they do today. Add research and) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 446 Td (interview counts when available.) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 432 Td (4\) List competitors or alternatives, estimate the potential market, and describe what makes) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 418 Td (the idea different. Unknown research can be left blank and will be flagged.) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 404 Td (5\) Enter a currency, selling price, variable cost per sale, monthly fixed costs, expected) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 390 Td (monthly sales, and optional initial investment.) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 376 Td (6\) Rate five readiness criteria from 1 to 5. These are your own ratings, not independently) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 362 Td (verified facts.) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 348 Td (7\) Review the answers and generate the assessment report. You can edit it later.) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 334 Td (8\) Duplicate a report to create a version, compare up to three ideas, export a report as JSON,) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 320 Td (or print/save the report as PDF.) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 306 Td (9\) To restore a report, open My Reports and choose Import JSON. Invalid files are rejected. If) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 292 Td (an ID is already saved, import as a separate copy or cancel; the existing report is never) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 278 Td (overwritten.) Tj ET
0.09 0.34 0.28 rg BT /F2 14 Tf 56 259 Td (4. Readiness score) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 239 Td (The app uses five weighted criteria. Each rating is from 1 to 5. An unrated item counts as) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 225 Td (zero and marks the report incomplete.) Tj ET
0.09 0.34 0.28 rg BT /F2 14 Tf 56 206 Td (Scoring criteria and weights) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 186 Td (Problem clarity: 20%) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 172 Td (Customer-demand evidence: 25%) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 158 Td (Competitive differentiation: 20%) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 144 Td (Financial feasibility: 20%) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 130 Td (Readiness to test: 15%) Tj ET
0.09 0.34 0.28 rg BT /F2 14 Tf 56 111 Td (Scoring formula) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 91 Td (Score = sum of \(criterion weight x rating / 5\) x 100. The weighted contributions are added to) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.18 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 56 77 Td (produce a score from 0 to 100. For example, ratings of 4, 3, 3, 3, and 4 produce 67/100.) Tj ET
